      "content": "1. The plot and dialogue of some main lines and branches have been revised and beautified\n2. Add a small branch line of the isolated island base: cross era dialogue, which can be triggered in the main building of the moon Pavilion in Chapter 2-5\n3. Add midknight Cop, after registering the company, you can go to your own company from the big map\n4. Maps such as central avenue have been expanded, and maps such as voice of saran reporter station have been added\n5. Add the loan function of vending machine\n6. Add the appreciation function of record player, which can collect records for playback\n7. \"Crops\" in the back garden are added\n8. Lower the threshold for purchasing superior suites\n9. Optimize some scene interactions\n10. Modified some NPC materials and scene materials\n11. The judgment of gun firing is optimized\n12. Add chat conversations for more NPCs\n13. The steam interface is still not accessible technically\n14. Fix several bugs\nI wish you a happy New Year~",
